    "details": "NAME\n  lang - Read or set the OS display language\n\nSYNOPSIS\n  lang [it|en|fr|es|de]\n\nDESCRIPTION\n  Without an argument it prints the active language and its generation counter. With one it sets the language for the whole OS, including the native panel UI.\n\nOPTIONS\n  [code]\n    One of it, en, fr, es, de.\n\nDEVICE COST\n  One GET or one POST /api/lang.\n\nSEE ALSO\n  status(1), theme(1)\n\nEXAMPLES\n  lang\n  lang it"
